    unit_outage_extract_basis_share: { cell: "U", ev: "Row added by nyiso-196 (2026-09-05) with the field, same PR (rule 28c). UNTESTED here (rule 28(d)): the defect is a per-ISO data property \u2014 whether an ISO\u0027s CC extract rows carry a unit/plant basis that differs from the fleet bin (an id collision like Cricket Valley\u0027s, an observed-peak or steam-augmented nameplate numerator over a net-summer bin) is measured per ISO from its own extract, and no NYISO verdict crosses the boundary (rule 25). The transfer question for this ISO is its OWN zero-LP census: unit_outage_derate_factors on/off per CC bin-year (the nyiso-196 _extract_basis_census construction)." },
