    caiso_ps_plant_params: { cell: "K", ev: "ARMED IN THE KEEPER (2026-08-16-caiso-197-w2-r5, via the composed Wave-2 ladder; O -> K at the caiso-197 §6 promotion). caiso-197 lane 5 (results/calibration/FINDING-caiso197-ps-physical-2026-08-16.md; PRECHECK + build @ 56ddf497a pre-solve; records _caiso197_ps_citations.json + _caiso197_l5_gates.json) — U -> O 2026-08-16: ACCEPTED 6/6 on the pre-registered gates (GATESPEC-caiso195, owner ruling 7 GO WITH SCOPE RESTRICTIONS). Zero MW added (G-AGG exact 2,077.6 = 2,077.6); zones mechanical NP15 (G-ZONE); static cited bounds only, Hyatt in-block (G-NOSHAPE — caiso-141 §G untouched); ledger 11/8 unchanged, zero fitted scalars (G-DOF); engagement the campaign's largest (25.5k/33.1k/30.1k zone-hours re-priced, class-hour dispatch to 4.5 GW; pump caps bind at Helms 930<1053 and Gianelli 375.8<424). C3a moved ANTI-favorably (+4.4/+12.8/+15.9 vs control +4.4/+11.7/+14.5) and the arm is accepted anyway — the direction-hazard clause operating as written (rule 14; caiso-183 lineage). C3b worsens but passes all years (0.098/0.178/0.183 vs 0.20; 2025 margin 0.017 recorded as the composition watch). No pass->fail flip. Run 2026-08-16-caiso-197-l5-psphys (control shared). Citations: PG&E Helms deck (data/raw/reference/pge-helms-ps-plant-2008), DWR B132-22 tables (dwr-b132-22-swp-plants), USBR EWA EIS Ch.16; Eastwood pump/duration UNCITED -> disclosed unrestrained/incumbent defaults. Cell K follows the Wave-2 §6 C3a-blind promotion if the final composed rung survives" },
